  "details": "Description\n\nWhen VRchat began to update on 2026 I haven't been able to watch videos anymore on worlds that had a video player. Everytime I try to watch a video I get the message saying \"Video error (Unable to load video.)\" and it has been like this for months.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nIt just happens everytime I play VRchat, the video player just won't work.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
